{"audio": "2corinthians-12.opus", "duration_ms": 191118, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 4200, "text": "2 Corinthians, Chapter Twelve."}, {"start_ms": 5160, "end_ms": 6241, "text": "I must go on boasting."}, {"start_ms": 6581, "end_ms": 11141, "text": "Although there is nothing to gain, I will go on to visions and revelations from the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 11801, "end_ms": 15781, "text": "I know a man in Christ who fourteen years ago was caught up to the third heaven."}, {"start_ms": 16262, "end_ms": 19782, "text": "Whether it was in the body or out of it I do not know, but God knows."}, {"start_ms": 20282, "end_ms": 26402, "text": "And I know that this man—whether in the body or out of it I do not know, but God knows— was caught up to Paradise."}, {"start_ms": 26943, "end_ms": 31643, "text": "The things he heard were inexpressible, things that man is not permitted to tell."}, {"start_ms": 32343, "end_ms": 37264, "text": "I will boast about such a man, but I will not boast about myself, except in my weaknesses."}, {"start_ms": 38184, "end_ms": 42804, "text": "Even if I wanted to boast, I would not be a fool, because I would be speaking the truth."}, {"start_ms": 43184, "end_ms": 51505, "text": "But I refrain, so no one will credit me with more than he sees in me or hears from me, or because of these surpassingly great revelations."}, {"start_ms": 52445, "end_ms": 58626, "text": "So to keep me from becoming conceited, I was given a thorn in my flesh, a messenger of Satan, to torment me."}, {"start_ms": 59526, "end_ms": 62446, "text": "Three times I pleaded with the Lord to take it away from me."}, {"start_ms": 62886, "end_ms": 74707, "text": "But He said to me, “My grace is sufficient for you, for My power is perfected in weakness.” Therefore I will boast all the more gladly in my weaknesses, so that the power of Christ may rest on me."}, {"start_ms": 75567, "end_ms": 83088, "text": "That is why, for the sake of Christ, I delight in weaknesses, in insults, in hardships, in persecutions, in difficulties."}, {"start_ms": 83648, "end_ms": 86288, "text": "For when I am weak, then I am strong."}, {"start_ms": 87568, "end_ms": 89928, "text": "I have become a fool, but you drove me to it."}, {"start_ms": 90449, "end_ms": 97489, "text": "In fact, you should have commended me, since I am in no way inferior to those “super-apostles,” even though I am nothing."}, {"start_ms": 98329, "end_ms": 104830, "text": "The marks of a true apostle—signs, wonders, and miracles—were performed among you with great perseverance."}, {"start_ms": 105390, "end_ms": 110190, "text": "In what way were you inferior to the other churches, except that I was not a burden to you?"}, {"start_ms": 110690, "end_ms": 111771, "text": "Forgive me this wrong!"}, {"start_ms": 112651, "end_ms": 119911, "text": "See, I am ready to come to you a third time, and I will not be a burden, because I am not seeking your possessions, but you."}, {"start_ms": 120911, "end_ms": 125172, "text": "For children should not have to save up for their parents, but parents for their children."}, {"start_ms": 125952, "end_ms": 130092, "text": "And for the sake of your souls, I will most gladly spend my money and myself."}, {"start_ms": 130732, "end_ms": 133093, "text": "If I love you more, will you love me less?"}, {"start_ms": 134133, "end_ms": 139973, "text": "Be that as it may, I was not a burden to you; but crafty as I am, I caught you by trickery."}, {"start_ms": 140713, "end_ms": 142953, "text": "Did I exploit you by anyone I sent you?"}, {"start_ms": 143534, "end_ms": 146754, "text": "I urged Titus to visit you, and I sent our brother with him."}, {"start_ms": 147414, "end_ms": 149234, "text": "Did Titus exploit you in any way?"}, {"start_ms": 149594, "end_ms": 153194, "text": "Did we not walk in the same Spirit and follow in the same footsteps?"}, {"start_ms": 154055, "end_ms": 157075, "text": "Have you been thinking all along that we were making a defense to you?"}, {"start_ms": 157675, "end_ms": 162155, "text": "We speak before God in Christ, and all of this, beloved, is to build you up."}, {"start_ms": 162835, "end_ms": 168936, "text": "For I am afraid that when I come, I may not find you as I wish, and you may not find me as you wish."}, {"start_ms": 169636, "end_ms": 176017, "text": "I fear that there may be quarreling, jealousy, rage, rivalry, slander, gossip, arrogance, and disorder."}, {"start_ms": 176937, "end_ms": 189498, "text": "I am afraid that when I come again, my God will humble me before you, and I will be grieved over many who have sinned earlier and have not repented of their acts of impurity, sexual immorality, and debauchery."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 2280, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 2280, "e": 3220, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 3220, "e": 3520, "si": 0}, {"t": "Twelve.", "s": 3560, "e": 4200, "si": 0}, {"t": "I", "s": 5160, "e": 5200, "si": 1}, {"t": "must", "s": 5220, "e": 5401, "si": 1}, {"t": "go", "s": 5441, "e": 5501, "si": 1}, {"t": "on", "s": 5621, "e": 5741, "si": 1}, {"t": "boasting.", "s": 5821, "e": 6241, "si": 1}, {"t": "Although", "s": 6581, "e": 6901, "si": 2}, {"t": "there", "s": 6921, "e": 7101, "si": 2}, {"t": "is", "s": 7141, "e": 7241, "si": 2}, {"t": "nothing", "s": 7321, "e": 7621, "si": 2}, {"t": "to", "s": 7641, "e": 7701, "si": 2}, {"t": "gain,", "s": 7781, "e": 8041, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 8261, "e": 8281, "si": 2}, {"t": "will", "s": 8301, "e": 8441, "si": 2}, {"t": "go", "s": 8461, "e": 8541, "si": 2}, {"t": "on", "s": 8721, "e": 8881, "si": 2}, {"t": "to", "s": 8981, "e": 9041, "si": 2}, {"t": "visions", "s": 9141, "e": 9621, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 9681, "e": 9801, "si": 2}, {"t": "revelations", "s": 9861, "e": 10521, "si": 2}, {"t": "from", "s": 10581, "e": 10721, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 10761, "e": 10841, "si": 2}, {"t": "Lord.", "s": 10881, "e": 11141, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 11801, "e": 11821, "si": 3}, {"t": "know", "s": 11841, "e": 12001, "si": 